In the result, we pass the following:
ORDER i. Appeal is allowed in part;
ii.

The judgment and award dated 23rd August, 2019 passed in MVC No.350 of 2017 by the NC: 2023:KHC-D:8928-DB Senior Civil Judge and Motor Accident Claims Tribunal at Kushtagi, is modified by enhancing the compensation to Rs.17,69,610/-
as against Rs.15,48,3900/- awarded by the Tribunal;
iii. The enhanced compensation amount carries interest at 6% per annum from the date of petition till its realisation.
